                <pb facs="1078" n="984" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg984"/>

                <head>No. 613.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Curry to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-03-10"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 10,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Curry informs the Department that the Government of Spain is willing to
                    extend the duration of the agreement of October 27, until the 30th of June
                    next.</p>
            </div>
